The bank's own workbooks live here, supplied per deployment.

CIMB BizConverter is CIMB's licensed tool and a filled copy carries the
customer's company details, so it cannot ship with Bills Hub or go in a
public repository. Save yours from Excel and drop it in here:

  CIMB BizConverter.xlsx

BizConverter accepts .xlsx and refuses .xlsm, so that is what Bills Hub
produces. A .xlsm copy here works just as well — the macros are removed
when the file is filled, since the converter does not use them.

Everything Bills Hub does not write is copied through byte for byte: all
eighteen sheets, CompanyInfo, the biller lists.
